# Template ONLY: install as .htaccess inside a NEW approved protected
# directory on NTNU once authorized. Apache will apply it recursively to
# files and nested subdirectories, including PDF, ZIP and video downloads.
# No passwords or password hashes belong in this repository.
#
# Verify the real absolute server path for AuthUserFile on the user's
# account. The htpasswd database must NOT be publicly downloadable or
# served from the protected/public website. If you cannot securely store
# this database outside the served web tree, use the LDAP template instead.
AuthName "FolkNettside protected folder"
AuthType Basic
AuthBasicProvider file
AuthUserFile "/REPLACE_WITH_VERIFIED_NONPUBLIC_SERVER_PATH/folk-v2-users.htpasswd"
Require valid-user
